      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Warning Bellow</h1><p><em>The bear’s roar fills the space between itself and its cubs.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-brown-bear-warning-bellow</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>One hearing creature within 3 squares gains Frightened 1 of the bear; once per turn.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
